 "summary": "Namma Sahayaka is a bilingual civic grievance assistant for Bengaluru that uses Gemini and a Model Context Protocol server to route issues to the correct ward and agency. The project shows solid architecture but lacks robust error handling and security guardrails.",
 "strengths": [
  "Clear separation into agent, tool, and MCP server modules",
  "Rich, curated civic data enabling deterministic, zero‑hallucination routing",
  "Well‑crafted multilingual prompt that produces actionable responses"
 ],
