  "Add input validation and output sanitisation for user messages and model responses to prevent injection attacks",
  "Implement retry/backoff, time‑out and token/step limits around Gemini API calls (currently missing) ",
  "Document the missing NODE_TEST_CONTEXT env var and remove excessive console.log statements"
 ],
